==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{m|sla-pro|*govoriti}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*gow(H)-||to call, cry}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ru-говорить.ogg|Audio|lang=ru}}
{{ru-pron-auto|говори́ть}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|говори́ть|impf|pf=сказа́ть}}

# to [[speak]], to [[talk]]
#: {{usex|lang=ru|Я '''говорю́''' по-ру́сски.|t=I speak Russian.|inline=y}}
# to [[say]], to [[tell]]
#: {{usex|lang=ru|Что она́ '''говори́т'''?|tr=Što oná '''govorít'''?|t=What is she saying?|inline=y}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj-4b|impf|говор|past_pasv_part=гово́ренный}}

